  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【鳴子温泉郷】日本屈指の多彩な泉質を巡る名湯宿7選！鳴子峡の紅葉と伝統こけしの街</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">温泉街を歩くだけで漂う心地よい硫黄の香り。下駄の音を響かせながら多彩な源泉を湯巡りし、鳴子峡のダイナミックな渓谷美に癒やされる本格的な温泉リトリートをご案内します。</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 厳選おすすめ宿泊施設</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-6 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/106139/106139.jpg\" alt=\"鳴子温泉郷　極上の貸切露天風呂　旅館大沼\" class=\"w-full md:w-48 h-36 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1.5\">\n        <span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold text-[10px] rounded-full\">特選おすすめ</span>\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-base leading-snug\">鳴子温泉郷　極上の貸切露天風呂　旅館大沼</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮城県大崎市鳴子温泉赤湯34 ｜ 東北新幹線『古川駅』よりＪＲ陸羽東線に乗り換え、『鳴子御殿湯駅』下車、徒歩５分。鳴子温泉からはタクシーで約5分。</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700 pt-1\">\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">⭐ 4.57（605件の評価）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">1名目安: ¥13,530〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-amber-50/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-100\">美肌湯が自慢の宮城・東鳴子温泉の秘湯宿。源泉かけ流しの天然温泉を使用した大浴場・家族風呂をご堪能。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-2\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D106139\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-stone-50/80 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 space-y-2.5\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/192804/192804.jpg\" alt=\"中山平温泉　あすか旅館\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-lg flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm\">中山平温泉　あすか旅館</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮城県大崎市鳴子温泉字星沼68-1</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 3.86</span>\n          <span>参考: ¥3,000〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D192804\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:underline\">\n        詳細・プランを見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-4 bg-amber-50/50 rounded-xl border border-amber-200\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xs text-amber-950 mb-2\">📌 あわせて読みたい関連旅行ガイド</h4>\n  <ul class=\"text-xs text-amber-900 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside\">\n    <li><a href=\"/posts/zao-ginzan-akyu-matsushima-naruko-tohoku-onsen-guide\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\">東北の名湯（蔵王・秋保・鳴子・松島）ランキング</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/posts/miyagi-famous-things-gourmet-spots-guide\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\">宮城県の特産品・地酒・名門宿ガイド</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 厳選おすすめ宿泊施設（追加セレクション）</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/5743/5743.jpg\" alt=\"鳴子温泉　ホテル亀屋\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">鳴子温泉　ホテル亀屋</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮城県大崎市鳴子温泉車湯54-6 ｜ JR陸羽東線鳴子温泉駅より徒歩15分  駅ご到着時、電話にてお迎えあり。東北自動車道、古川ＩＣよりお車で４０分。</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 3.81（1141件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥7,900〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">源泉掛け流しの露天風呂と広々とした大浴場、地場の風味を大切にしたお料理をご用意し皆様をお迎えします。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D5743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/106199/106199.jpg\" alt=\"鳴子温泉　名湯の宿　鳴子ホテル\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">鳴子温泉　名湯の宿　鳴子ホテル</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮城県大崎市鳴子温泉湯元36 ｜ JR鳴子温泉駅より徒歩にて５分。仙台駅から古川駅経由で電車で60分。</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.43（2697件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥9,900〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">様々な色に変化するとろとろ美肌の湯は自然が奏でる温泉美。創業明治６年の湯治文化を伝承する温泉宿。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D106199\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/9300/9300.jpg\" alt=\"鳴子温泉　源蔵の湯　鳴子観光ホテル\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">鳴子温泉　源蔵の湯　鳴子観光ホテル</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮城県大崎市鳴子温泉湯元 ｜ 古川(東北新幹線)→鳴子温泉駅(陸羽東線)</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.26（1102件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥8,250〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">【創業400年の老舗】～オールインクルーシブスタイルの温泉宿～</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D9300\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/13890/13890.jpg\" alt=\"鬼首温泉　リゾートパーク　ホテル　オニコウベ\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">鬼首温泉　リゾートパーク　ホテル　オニコウベ</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮城県大崎市鳴子温泉鬼首大清水26-29 ｜ 東北自動車道古川ICより47号線を鳴子方面へ、岩下こけし資料館前交差点から108号線を秋田方面に入り約20分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.39（463件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥3,850〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">大自然に囲まれたリゾートホテル～宮城県北唯一プールのある施設</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D13890\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/108117/108117.jpg\" alt=\"飯坂温泉　伊東園ホテル飯坂　叶や\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">飯坂温泉　伊東園ホテル飯坂　叶や</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">福島県福島市飯坂町湯野字上川原2-4 ｜ 飯坂温泉駅から徒歩で１５分(飯坂温泉駅からの送迎あり。詳しくはホテルまでお問合せください)</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 3.69（994件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥6,248〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">最寄り駅より徒歩１５分。摺上川や対岸の四季折々の風景を眺めながらゆったりくつろげる大浴場が楽しめます</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D108117\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D106139\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n    🛎️ 【公式楽天トラベル】鳴子温泉郷　極上の貸切露天風呂　旅館大沼の限定クーポン＆空室を見る\n  </a>\n</div>"
